    },
    {
      "id": "song-857",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "鹊桥仙",
      "subtitle": "星移斗转玉蟾西",
      "author": "苏氏",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "星移斗转，玉蟾西下，渐觉东郊向晓。\n马嘶人语隔霜林，望千里、长安古道。\n珠宫姊妹，相逢方信，别后十分瘦了。\n上林归去正花时，争奈向、花前又老。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "ee4397d2f39ca44e63fbdf952c5570d6b2814e6f2f759ee8def5362561a95f9a",
      "estimatedOutput": 742,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-857--ee4397d2f39ca44e63fbdf952c5570d6b2814e6f2f759ee8def5362561a95f9a.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-858",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "踏莎行",
      "subtitle": "孤馆深沈晓寒天",
      "author": "苏氏",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "孤馆深沈，晓寒天气。\n解鞍独自阑干倚。\n暗香浮动月黄昏，落梅风送沾衣袂。\n待写红笺，凭谁与寄。\n先教觅取嬉游地。\n到家正是早春时，小桃花下拼沈醉。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "8c3984aa3f5586ad1a5c8da2a4158f5635fd56fac7d6f319fc3b8393f9e75611",
      "estimatedOutput": 746,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-858--8c3984aa3f5586ad1a5c8da2a4158f5635fd56fac7d6f319fc3b8393f9e75611.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-859",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "清平乐",
      "subtitle": "小山丛桂最有留",
      "author": "刘敞",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "小山丛桂。\n最有留人意。\n拂叶攀花无限思。\n雨湿浓香满袂。\n别来过了秋光。\n翠帘昨夜新霜。\n多少月宫闲地，姮娥与借微芳。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "5625925923116749c9adf85d2d69c2f3f738e02dc4efa2f81fab00ceaf46c0fc",
      "estimatedOutput": 720,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-859--5625925923116749c9adf85d2d69c2f3f738e02dc4efa2f81fab00ceaf46c0fc.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-860",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "踏莎行",
      "subtitle": "蜡炬高高龙烟细",
      "author": "刘敞",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "蜡炬高高，龙烟细细。\n玉楼十二门初闭。\n疏帘不卷水晶寒，小屏半掩琉璃翠。\n桃叶新声，榴花美味。\n南山宾客东山妓。\n利名不肯放人闲，忙中偷取工夫醉。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "72662d81a5c9f03a0e35a9025fe67915206fe84adc3df5485f3c79088b43bf60",
